            },
            "text": "Two strata; two treatments A and B; binary outcome (success/failure)."
          },
          "target_span": {
            "start": {
              "line": 2,
              "col": 1
            },
            "end": {
              "line": 2,
              "col": 68
            },
            "text": "দুটি স্তর; দুটি চিকিৎসা A এবং B; বাইনারি ফলাফল (সাফল্য/ব্যর্থতা)।"
          },
          "kind": "comment",
          "reaches_output": "none",
          "placeholders": []
