              "line": 3,
              "col": 1
            },
            "end": {
              "line": 3,
              "col": 72
            },
            "text": "Constructed so that A > B within each stratum, but B > A when pooled."
          },
          "target_span": {
            "start": {
              "line": 3,
              "col": 1
            },
            "end": {
              "line": 3,
              "col": 76
            },
            "text": "এমনভাবে গঠিত যাতে প্রতিটি স্তরের মধ্যে A > B, কিন্তু পুল করার সময় B > A।"
          },
          "kind": "comment",
          "reaches_output": "none",
          "placeholders": []
